(BUREAU OF INDIAN STANDARDS) Tj
T*
(MUTUAL RECOGNITION AGREEMENTS \(MRA\) & TRADE TREATIES) Tj
T*
(STATUS AS OF 2026) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(India has entered into several Mutual Recognition Agreements \(MRAs\), Comprehensive Economic ) Tj
T*
(Partnership Agreements \(CEPAs\), and Free Trade Agreements \(FTAs\) that include technical ) Tj
T*
(standards chapters. These treaties allow:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Acceptance of foreign test reports from accredited labs) Tj
T*
(2. Exemption from Indian lab testing \(testing waiver\)) Tj
T*
(3. Exemption from factory audit for certain categories \(audit waiver\)) Tj
T*
(4. Reduced processing time \(4-8 weeks faster\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ACTIVE TREATIES WITH TESTING WAIVERS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. GERMANY  Indo-German Technical Cooperation Agreement \(2018\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Agreement Type: MRA) Tj
T*
(   Sectors Covered: Electronics, Automotive, Electrical Appliances) Tj
T*
(   IS Standards Covered: IS 16046, IS 15844, IS 13252, IS 2082) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Testing Waiver: YES \(DAkkS-accredited lab reports accepted\)) Tj
T*
(   Audit Waiver: NO \(factory audit still required for Scheme-I\)) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Effective Date: January 1, 2018) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Notes: European lab reports from DAkkS-accredited testing facilities are accepted ) Tj
T*
(   for the initial FMCS application. This saves 4-6 weeks of Indian lab testing time.) Tj
T*
(   However, BIS officer audit at the German factory is still mandatory.) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Eligible Products: ECUs, LED lamps, IT equipment, geysers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. EUROPEAN UNION  EU-India FTA Technical Annex \(2020\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Agreement Type: MRA \(within broader FTA framework\)) Tj
T*
(   Sectors Covered: Electronics, Automotive, Safety Equipment) Tj
T*
(   IS Standards Covered: IS 15844, IS 13252, IS 4151) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Testing Waiver: YES \(CE-marked products with equivalent safety docs\)) Tj
T*
(   Audit Waiver: NO) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Effective Date: March 15, 2020) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Notes: Products bearing CE mark with conformity declaration and technical file may ) Tj
T*
(   submit EU test reports in lieu of Indian lab testing. Saves 4 weeks.) Tj
T*
(   ) Tj
T*
(   Applies to: EU member states \(27 countries as of 2026\)) Tj
